" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>MORNING BRUNCH</b><small>01</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 2-PRIVATE YACHT DEPARTURE.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 2 · PRIVATE YACHT DEPARTURE\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 2-PRIVATE YACHT DEPARTURE.webp\" alt=\"DAY 2 · PRIVATE YACHT DEPARTURE\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>PRIVATE YACHT DEPARTURE</b><small>02</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 2-YACHT OCEAN SWIM.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 2 · YACHT OCEAN SWIM\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 2-YACHT OCEAN SWIM.webp\" alt=\"DAY 2 · YACHT OCEAN SWIM\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>YACHT OCEAN SWIM</b><small>03</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 2-SUNSET BEACH WALK.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 2 · SUNSET BEACH WALK\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 2-SUNSET BEACH WALK.webp\" alt=\"DAY 2 · SUNSET BEACH WALK\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>SUNSET BEACH WALK</b><small>04</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 2-PRIVATE BARBECUE PARTY.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 2 · PRIVATE BARBECUE PARTY\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 2-PRIVATE BARBECUE PARTY.webp\" alt=\"DAY 2 · PRIVATE BARBECUE PARTY\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>PRIVATE BARBECUE PARTY</b><small>05</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 2-DOHA&amp;TAEHOON.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 2 · DOHA &amp; TAEHOON\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 2-DOHA&amp;TAEHOON.webp\" alt=\"DAY 2 · DOHA &amp; TAEHOON\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>DOHA &amp; TAEHOON</b><small>06</small></span></button></div></div></section><section class=\"archive26-chapter section\" id=\"day-3\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"archive26-head reveal\"><div><span>DAY 03</span><h2>Day 3</h2></div><p>5 ORIGINAL PHOTOS</p></div><div class=\"archive26-grid\"><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 3-TENNIS.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 3 · TENNIS\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 3-TENNIS.webp\" alt=\"DAY 3 · TENNIS\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>TENNIS</b><small>01</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 3-DOHA&amp;TAEHOON.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 3 · DOHA &amp; TAEHOON\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 3-DOHA&amp;TAEHOON.webp\" alt=\"DAY 3 · DOHA &amp; TAEHOON\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>DOHA &amp; TAEHOON</b><small>02</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 3-AFTERNOON POOLSIDE BREAK.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 3 · AFTERNOON POOLSIDE BREAK\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 3-AFTERNOON POOLSIDE BREAK.webp\" alt=\"DAY 3 · AFTERNOON POOLSIDE BREAK\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>AFTERNOON POOLSIDE BREAK</b><small>03</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 3-FAILED ROOM INVASION.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 3 · FAILED ROOM INVASION\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 3-FAILED ROOM INVASION.webp\" alt=\"DAY 3 · FAILED ROOM INVASION\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>FAILED ROOM INVASION</b><small>04</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 3-JIWOO&amp;TAEHOON.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 3 · JIWOO &amp; TAEHOON\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 3-JIWOO&amp;TAEHOON.webp\" alt=\"DAY 3 · JIWOO &amp; TAEHOON\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>JIWOO &amp; TAEHOON</b><small>05</small></span></button></div></div></section><section class=\"archive26-chapter section\" id=\"day-4\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"archive26-head reveal\"><div><span>DAY 04</span><h2>Day 4</h2></div><p>4 ORIGINAL PHOTOS</p></div><div class=\"archive26-grid\"><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 4-BREALFAST.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 4 · BREAKFAST\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 4-BREALFAST.webp\" alt=\"DAY 4 · BREAKFAST\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>BREAKFAST</b><small>01</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 4-PACK UP.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 4 · PACK UP\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 4-PACK UP.webp\" alt=\"DAY 4 · PACK UP\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>PACK UP</b><small>02</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 4-DRIVING.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 4 · DRIVING\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 4-DRIVING.webp\" alt=\"DAY 4 · DRIVING\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>DRIVING</b><small>03</small></span></button><button class=\"archive26-photo\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 4-DUTYFREE SHOPPING.webp\" data-title=\"DAY 4 · DUTY-FREE SHOPPING\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/NIGHT OFF SUMMER-DAY 4-DUTYFREE SHOPPING.webp\" alt=\"DAY 4 · DUTY-FREE SHOPPING\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>DUTY-FREE SHOPPING</b><small>04</small></span></button></div></div></section><section class=\"nightoff-live section\" id=\"after-live\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"archive26-head reveal\"><div><span>AFTER THE VACATION</span><h2>First live back.</h2></div><p>10 LIVE MOMENTS · FULL TALK ARCHIVE</p></div><div class=\"nightoff-live-intro\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">NIGHT × LUNA</p><p>휴가가 끝난 뒤 다시 모인 다섯 멤버. LUNA의 질문으로 시작해 방 순회 사건, 수영복, 테니스 판정과 마지막 밤까지 이어진 첫 라이브의 기록입니다.</p></div><div class=\"nightoff-live-grid\"><article class=\"nightoff-live-episode\"><button class=\"archive26-photo nightoff-live-still\" type=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/live/live-01.webp\" data-title=\"AFTER LIVE · 01 · 휴가 후 첫 라이브 — 태훈의 방 순회 사건\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/live/live-01.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT OFF SUMMER AFTER LIVE 01\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>LIVE 01</b><small>01</small></span></button><details class=\"nightoff-live-dialogue\"><summary><small>01</small><span>휴가 후 첫 라이브 — 태훈의 방 순회 사건</span></summary><div><p><strong>LUNA</strong><span>태훈이는 왜 휴가 내내 자기 방에서 안 잤어요? ㅋㅋㅋㅋ</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>아니, 내 방에서도 있었어요!</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>있었대. 잤다고는 안 하고.</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>형들이랑 같이 자는 게 좋으니까요.</span></p><p><strong>JIWOO</strong><span>그래서 매일 베개 들고 돌아다녔어?</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>네.</span></p><p><strong>IHWAN</strong><span>저렇게 당당할 일인가.</span></p><p><strong>DOHA</strong><span>그래도 잘 자던데.</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>형은 잘 잤겠지.</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>아무튼 전 만족했어요.</span></p></div></details></article><article class=\"nightoff-live-episode\"><button class=\"archive26-photo nightoff-live-still\" type=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/live/live-02.webp\" data-title=\"AFTER LIVE · 02 · 윤도하 수영복 본인 선택 사건\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/live/live-02.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT OFF SUMMER AFTER LIVE 02\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>LIVE 02</b><small>02</small></span></button><details class=\"nightoff-live-dialogue\"><summary><small>02</small><span>윤도하 수영복 본인 선택 사건</span></summary><div><p><strong>LUNA</strong><span>도하 그 수영복 진짜 본인이 고른 거예요?</span></p><p><strong>DOHA</strong><span>네.</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ</span></p><p><strong>JIWOO</strong><span>대답이 왜 이렇게 빨라.</span></p><p><strong>DOHA</strong><span>제가 골랐으니까요.</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>여러분, 회사가 시킨 거 아닙니다.</span></p><p><strong>IHWAN</strong><span>캐슬은 억울했네.</span></p><p><strong>DOHA</strong><span>편해 보여서 골랐어요.</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>형만 편했지. 팬들은 안 편했을걸?</span></p><p><strong>DOHA</strong><span>왜?</span></p><p><strong>JIWOO</strong><span>됐다. 다음 질문 보자.</span></p></div></details></article><article class=\"nightoff-live-episode\"><button class=\"archive26-photo nightoff-live-still\" type=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/live/live-03.webp\" data-title=\"AFTER LIVE · 03 · 박이환 방 침입 실패 사건\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/live/live-03.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT OFF SUMMER AFTER LIVE 03\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>LIVE 03</b><small>03</small></span></button><details class=\"nightoff-live-dialogue\"><summary><small>03</small><span>박이환 방 침입 실패 사건</span></summary><div><p><strong>LUNA</strong><span>이환이는 왜 태훈이 방에 못 들어오게 했어요? 😂</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>맞아요. 저 문 앞까지 갔어요.</span></p><p><strong>IHWAN</strong><span>그래서?</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>형 방에서 자려고 했죠.</span></p><p><strong>IHWAN</strong><span>왜 내 방에서 자.</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>다른 형들은 다 재워줬는데!</span></p><p><strong>DOHA</strong><span>그건 맞아.</span></p><p><strong>IHWAN</strong><span>형은 재워주고 싶었으니까 재워준 거고.</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>이환이 논리 확실하다.</span></p><p><strong>JIWOO</strong><span>그래서 내가 데려갔잖아.</span></p><p><strong>LUNA</strong><span>이환이 문 잠갔어요?</span></p><p><strong>IHWAN</strong><span>네.</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>진짜 바로 잠갔어요.</span></p></div></details></article><article class=\"nightoff-live-episode\"><button class=\"archive26-photo nightoff-live-still\" type=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/live/live-04.webp\" data-title=\"AFTER LIVE · 04 · 결국 지우가 태훈을 안고 잔 사건\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/live/live-04.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT OFF SUMMER AFTER LIVE 04\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>LIVE 04</b><small>04</small></span></button><details class=\"nightoff-live-dialogue\"><summary><small>04</small><span>결국 지우가 태훈을 안고 잔 사건</span></summary><div><p><strong>LUNA</strong><span>지우가 결국 태훈이 안고 잤다는 게 사실인가요???</span></p><p><strong>JIWOO</strong><span>어. 자다가 보니까.</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>저 잘 잤어요.</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>아무도 네 수면 만족도 안 물어봤어.</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>그래도 궁금할 수 있잖아요.</span></p><p><strong>IHWAN</strong><span>안 궁금해.</span></p><p><strong>DOHA</strong><span>잘 잤으면 됐지.</span></p><p><strong>LUNA</strong><span>지우는 원래 잘 때 사람 안아요?</span></p><p><strong>JIWOO</strong><span>아니?</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>……어?</span></p><p><strong>IHWAN</strong><span>아니래.</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>저는 안아줬는데요.</span></p><p><strong>JIWOO</strong><span>네가 옆에 있었으니까 그런 거지.</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>설명할수록 이상해지는데?</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>저는 좋았어요.</span></p><p><strong>JIWOO</strong><span>넌 좀 조용히 해.</span></p></div></details></article><article class=\"nightoff-live-episode\"><button class=\"archive26-photo nightoff-live-still\" type=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/live/live-05.webp\" data-title=\"AFTER LIVE · 05 · 윤도하 수면 방어력 MAX 사건\"><img src=\"assets/images/night-off-summer/live/live-05.webp\" alt=\"NIGHT OFF SUMMER AFTER LIVE 05\" loading=\"lazy\"><span><b>LIVE 05</b><small>05</small></span></button><details class=\"nightoff-live-dialogue\"><summary><small>05</small><span>윤도하 수면 방어력 MAX 사건</span></summary><div><p><strong>LUNA</strong><span>도하는 태훈이랑 자고 왜 다음 날 그렇게 멀쩡했어요?</span></p><p><strong>DOHA</strong><span>잤으니까요.</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>나도 잤어.</span></p><p><strong>DOHA</strong><span>그럼 됐네.</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>안 됐으니까 말하는 거잖아.</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>제가 뭐 했는데요?</span></p><p><strong>WOOHYUN</strong><span>계속 뒤척였어.</span></p><p><strong>TAEHOON</strong><span>도하 형은 아무 말 안 하던데.</span></p><p><strong>DOHA</